        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Grandeur SOLSOL, Soleil Knob</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Soleil Knob is a great example of how modern tastes can affect traditional style to form something beautiful. The lined design is a classic, but the flat-faced knob brings the Soleil Knobset  into the realm of contemporary home decorating. This Soleil Knob with Matching Rose is available in passage, privacy, and dummy functions.  It can fit 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Features</b> of the Grandeur SOLSOL Soleil Knob:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Made out of solid forged brass.</li>\r\n<li>Easy to install.</li>\r\n<li>Lifetime Mechanical Warranty</li>\r\n<li>10 Year Finish Warranty</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Soleil Knob with Matching Rose:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Knob Diameter: 2.375\"</li>\r\n<li>Knob Projection: 2.625\"</li>\r\n<li>Rose Diameter: 2.7\"</li>\r\n<li>Door Thickness: Adjustable 1-3/8\" to 1-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Backset: 2-3/8\" or 2-3/4\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/GRA-SOLSOL-specifications.pdf?v=1704262326\" target=\"new\"><b>Grandeur SOLSOL Dimensions (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>When Selecting A Function:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li><b>Single Dummy:</b> A surfaced mounted, non-working knob. Non-locking and non-latching trim for one side of door. This inactive pull is usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Double Dummy:</b> Surfaced mounted, non-working knobs. Non-locking and non-latching trim for both sides of door. These inactive pulls are usually used to match trim.</li>\r\n<li><b>Passage (hall or closet):</b> Latches but does not lock. The latch is activated by turning the either of the two knobs.</li>\r\n<li><b>Privacy (bedroom or bathroom):</b> Latches and can be locked. Can be locked from the inside with a push-button.</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</li>\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Soleil Knobset",
                "description": "Grandeur SOLSOL, Soleil Knobset - The Traditional Soleil Knob is a great example of how modern tastes can affect traditional style to form something beautiful. The lined design is a classic, but the flat-faced knob brings the Soleil Knobset  into the realm of contemporary home decorating. This Traditional Knob is available in passage, privacy, and dummy functions.  It can fit 1-3/8 inch to 1-3/4 inch thick doors with 2-3/8 inch or 2-3/4 inch backsets.\r\n",
